        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 16A5, 1-1/2 x 11 Rectangular Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek Door Configuration #6 - The Modern 1-1/2 x 11 Multi Point Handleset is configured to fit Milgard and Pella brand patio doors with multipoint lock mechanisms already installed. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The 1.5 x 11 Rectangular Multi Point Handleset features an American Cylinder below the lever and has 3-5/8 inch centers. Choose from several contemporary finishes and sleek lever trim choices for a modern look that represents your style. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does Not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Door-configuration-6-specifcations.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"186\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #6 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Brass Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-1.x11-config-6-specificaion.pdf?v=1704262361\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 16A5 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
