                "description": "The Modern 1-1/2 x 11 Multi Point Handleset is configured to fit Milgard and Pella brand patio doors with multipoint lock mechanisms already installed. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The 1.5 x 11 Rectangular Multi Point Handleset features an American Cylinder below the lever and has 3-5/8 inch centers. Choose from several contemporary finishes and sleek lever trim choices for a modern look that represents your style.",
                "keywords": "Brass Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6, Brass Modern Configuration 6 Patio Trims, Modern 1-1/2 x 11 Multi Point Handlesets, Emtek 16A5, Emtek 16A1, Emtek 16A3, Emtek 16A4, Emtek 16A2, EMT-16A5, Rectangular Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle, contemporary patio door locks, modern patio door locks, american cylinder multipoint trim sets, American cylinder below levers, American profile cylinder locksets, Milgard Multi Point Trim replacements, Pella Multi Point Trim replacements, Emtek Door Configuration #6 nation locks,"
